\v 8 \add ≈Later\add* when Elisha¦174286 the man of¦174287 God¦174289 heard¦174284 that Yisrael's¦174295 king had¦174292 torn¦174292 his clothes, he sent¦174299 \add ≈a message\add* to the king, “Why did¦174305 you¦174305 tear¦174305 your¦174306 clothes? Please¦174309, let¦174307 \add ≈that man\add* come¦174307 to me¦174310 \add ≈so¦174311 he can\add* know¦174311 that there¦174313 \em is\em* a prophet¦174314 in¦174315 Yisrael.”
