\v 11 \add ≈But¦174344\add* Na'aman was¦174344 furious, and he left, saying, “Listen, I said to¦174350 myself that he'd surely¦174353 come out and stand¦174354 \add there\add* and call¦174355 on¦174356 the name¦174356 of¦174356 his god¦174359 Yahweh¦174358, then¦174344 he'd wave¦174360 his hand¦174361 \add ≈over my body\add* and take away the skin¦174366 disease¦174366.
