\v 26 “\add ≈Wasn't I there in spirit when\add* a man¦174693 turned¦174691 from¦174694 on his¦174695 chariot¦174695 to meet¦174696 you¦174696?” \add @Elisha\add* said¦174684 to him, “Is this a time¦174697 to take silver¦174701 or clothing¦174703, or to take olive¦174704 trees¦174704 or vineyards¦174705, or sheep¦174706 or cattle¦174707, or male¦174708 or female¦174709 servants¦174708?
\v 27 \add Because of that,\add* Na'aman's leprosy¦174711 will¦174713 \add ≈transfer\add* to you¦174715 and to your¦174716 offspring¦174716 forever¦174717.” When¦174711 \add @Gehazi\add* \add ≈left the room, his¦174719 skin had¦174720 gone white as snow¦174721 and he¦174718 was now a leper\add*.
\c 6
\s1 The floating axe head
