\p
\v 1 \add One day,\add* the \add ≈prophets-in-training¦174727\add* said¦174724 to Elisha¦174730, “Please¦174733 look, The¦174734 place¦174734 where¦174735 we're sitting \add ≈to learn from you\add* is¦174740 too¦174740 narrow \add ≈to fit us¦174741 all in\add*.
\v 2 Please¦174745, let us go¦174743 \add ≈down by\add* the¦174748 Yordan¦174748 \add river\add*, and let \add ≈each of us cut down and bring back a log\add* from¦174750 there¦174750 \add ≈to make¦174754 a new classroom for¦174756 us to sit in\add*.”
