\v 3 \add ≈Then¦175928 eventually after\add* seven¦175930 years¦175931, the woman¦175933 returned¦175932 from¦175934 the Philistines' \add ≈region¦175934\add* and she¦175936 went¦175936 \add ≈to petition\add* the king¦175940 \add ≈about\add* her¦175943 house¦175943 and land¦175934.
