\v 7 Elisha¦176052 went¦176051 to \add Aram's capital\add* Damascus¦176053 at a time when King¦176057 Ben-Hadad of Aram \add !(Syria¦176059)\add* was \add very\add* sick¦176060, and¦176061 someone told¦176061 him¦176063 that the¦176066 man¦176066 of God¦176067 was in town.
