\v 11 Then¦176144 \add @Elisha\add* \add ≈stared at him until¦176149\add* \add @Haza'el\add* \add ≈felt embarrassed\add*, and¦176144 then¦176144 the¦176153 man¦176153 of¦176153 God¦176154 started to cry.
