\p “Because¦176162 I know¦176164 what evil things you'll do¦176168 to¦176169 the \add ≈Israelis¦176170\add*,” he said. “You'll \add ≈burn down\add* their fortresses¦176172 and kill¦176177 their young¦176175 men¦176175 with¦176174 the sword¦176176. You'll smash their children's¦176178 \add heads on rocks\add*, and rip¦176181 open¦176181 \add the bellies of\add* their pregnant¦176180 women¦176180.”
