\v 13 Haza'el¦176184 \add ≈asked\add*, “But¦176183 \add ≈how could\add* your¦176187 servant¦176187 \add be in a position to\add* do¦176190 such a major thing¦176191 \add ≈when he's only minor, like a\add* dog¦176188 \add in the palace\add*?”
