\v 15 \add ≈the very next¦176226\add* day¦176226, \add @Haza'el\add* dipped¦176229 \add @Ben-Hadad's\add* blanket in water¦176230 and held it over¦176232 his face¦176234 \add until\add* he¦176235 died¦176235, and then¦176225 Haza'el \add ≈started to reign\add* in his place¦176238.
