\v 16 In¦176241 the fifth year¦176241 of \add the reign of\add* Ahab's¦176246 son Yoram¦176243 as king of Yisrael¦176248, Yehoshafat's¦176249 son Yehoram¦176253 became¦176252 king of Yehudah¦176258.
\v 17 He¦176265 was¦176265 thirty-two¦176262 when¦176266 he became¦176266 king¦176266 and¦176267 he reigned¦176270 from Yerushalem¦176271 for eight¦176267 years¦176268.
