\v 29 King Yoram returned¦176483 to Yizre'el \add !(Jezreel)\add* to \add ≈recover\add* from¦176488 the wounds¦176490 that¦176491 Arameans¦176493 had \add ≈given\add* him¦176492 at¦176487 Ramah¦176494 when¦176495 he'd fought¦176495 with¦176487 Aram's¦176493 King Haza'el. \add Later,\add* King Ahazyah¦176501 of Yehudah¦176506 (Yehoram's¦176504 son), went¦176507 down¦176507 to see¦176508 (Ahab's¦176514 son) Yoram in¦176487 Yizre'el because¦176516 he was wounded¦176492.
\c 9
