\p
\v 1 Then the prophet¦176523 Elisha¦176522 called to one¦176525 of the \add ≈prophets-in-training¦176527\add* and told him¦176529, “\add ≈Tuck your¦176531 robe in\add*, take¦176532 this flask¦176533 of oil¦176534, and \add ≈hurry\add* to Ramot¦176538-Gilead¦176539.
