\v 3 and pour¦176567 \add some of\add* the olive oil¦176566 over his¦176570 head¦176570 and tell him that Yahweh¦176575 says¦176574 that he's¦176574 anointed¦176576 him as king¦176577 over Yisrael¦176580. Then¦176563 open¦176581 the door¦176582 and \add ≈get out of there fast\add*.”
\v 4 \add ≈So¦176587\add* the young¦176588 prophet¦176590 went¦176587 to Ramot¦176591-Gilead¦176592,
