\v 6 \add ≈So¦176614\add* \add @Yehu\add* got up¦176614, and \add ≈went¦176615 over\add* to¦176616 the house¦176616 \add ≈where\add* \add @the prophet\add* poured¦176617 the oil¦176618 on his¦176621 head¦176621 and told him¦176623, “Yisrael's¦176629 god¦176628 Yahweh says¦176626 that he's¦176626 anointed¦176630 you¦176630 as king¦176631 over Yahweh's¦176627 people¦176634—over Yisrael.
\v 7 You¦176646 should attack the house¦176643 of Ahab¦176644 your¦176645 master¦176645 so \add @Yahweh¦176655\add* can avenge the \add ≈murder\add* of his servants, the prophets¦176650, and¦176640 \add ≡avenge\add* the \add ≈murder\add* of all¦176652 his servants \add ≈who were killed by\add* Izevel¦176657 \add !(Jezebel¦176657)\add*.
