\v 9 \add @Yahweh\add* \add ≈wants Ahab's¦176676 descendants to be eliminated like¦176677 the¦176677 descendants of¦176677 Nebat's¦176681 son Yarave'am¦176678 and¦176682 Ahiyah's¦176686 son Baasha¦176683 were\add*.
