\v 11 \add ≈When¦176701\add* Yehu came¦176711 back \add to the room where\add* the servants¦176705 of¦176725 his masters¦176706 were, and¦176707 \add #they\add* \add ≈asked\add* him¦176708, “\add ≈Is everything okay\add*? \add ≈What did¦176711 that madman¦176713 want with\add* you¦176715?”
