\v 13 Then¦176748 they all spread¦176752 their cloaks on the steps¦176757 of¦176756 the building \add ≈for Yehu to walk out on\add*, and they blew a trumpet¦176759 and \add ≈shouted\add*, “Yehu is¦176761 \add now\add* the king¦176761!”
