\v 20 Then¦176923 the¦176924 watchman¦176924 declared, “He¦176926 \add also\add* \add ≈met with¦176940 them¦176929 but¦176923 didn't¦176930 return\add*. \add ≈The¦176933 leader is¦176934 riding\add* like Nimshi's¦176938 son¦176936 Yehu¦176935, because¦176939 he's¦176941 riding \add ≈like crazy\add*.”
