\v 27 Yehudah's¦177078 King¦177076 Ahazyah saw¦177079 \add that happen\add*, and¦177075 he \add ≈sped away through the¦177081 garden by a\add* house¦177082 \add ≈with¦177095 Yehu¦177086 chasing after¦177085 him shouting\add*, “\add ≈Get him too in¦177095 his chariot¦177094 when he starts climbing upwards to\add* Gur¦177097 near Yibleam.” \add ≈So¦177075 as\add* he fled¦177102 towards Megiddo¦177103, he \add ≈was killed\add* there¦177105,
