\v 4 In¦178099 the seventh¦178100 year¦178099, Yehoyada \add the priest\add* sent¦178101 for the \add ≈officers over the royal bodyguards and the palace bodyguards to come to him¦178114 inside Yahweh's¦178116 temple\add*. \add ≈He¦178117 made¦178117 them agree to take¦178103 an¦178120 oath¦178120 of¦178122\add* \add secrecy and loyalty\add* \add ≈in¦178099 the temple, then he¦178124 let them\add* see¦178124 the king's¦178130 son¦178128.
