\v 6 \add ≈Everything else that¦180164 Azaryah¦180161 said and¦180162 did¦180165 is written¦180169 in the book of the events\add* of the kings¦180175 of Yehudah¦180176.
\v 7 Azaryah¦180179 \add ≈died\add* and was buried¦180183 in \add ≈the ancestral tomb\add* in the city¦180188 of David¦180189, and his¦180193 son¦180192 Yotam¦180191 \add ≈replaced him¦180193 as\add* king¦180190.\x + \xo 15:7: \xt Isa 6:1.\x*
