\v 11 \add ≈Everything else that Zekaryah said and¦180249 did is written¦180253 in the book of the events\add* of the kings¦180259 of Yisrael¦180260.
\p
\v 12 \add Previously\add* Yahweh¦180265 had told \add King\add* Yehu¦180270 that his descendants¦180272 would sit¦180274 on¦180276 the¦180278 throne¦180278 for¦180275 four generations¦180273, and¦180280 that had come \add ≈true\add*.\x + \xo 15:12: \xt 2Ki 10:30.\x*
