\v 9 The king¦180982 of Assyria¦180983 listened¦180980 to him and \add ≈went in and attacked\add* Damascus¦180989, and he captured¦180990 it and exiled¦180991 \add @its people\add* to Kir¦180992, and he executed \add King\add* Retsin.
