\v 10 King Ahaz¦181000 went¦180998 to meet¦181001 the Assyrian King Tiglat¦181002-Pileser in¦181013 Damascus¦181007, and he saw¦181008 the altar that¦181012 was¦181013 \add *there\add*. \add ≈So¦180998\add* he sent¦181014 \add ≈a drawing and the detailed measurements\add* of¦181023 the altar to the priest¦181020 Uriyah.
