\v 1 In¦181269 the¦181273 twelfth year¦181269 of¦181273 King¦181273 Ahaz's¦181272 \add reign\add* over Yehudah¦181274, Elah's¦181279 son Hoshea¦181276 became¦181275 king over Yisrael¦181283 \add and he reigned\add* from Shomron¦181280 \add !(Samaria¦181280)\add* for nine¦181284 years¦181285.
