\s4 Northern kingdom
\p
\v 24 Then the Assyrian king¦181734 sent people¦181746 from Babylon¦181737 and from Kutah and from Avva and from Hamat¦181740 and Sefarvayim, and he¦181742 settled¦181742 them¦181742 in the cities¦181743 of \add ≈the northern kingdom\add* in place¦181745 of the \add ≈Israelis¦181747\add*. And¦181748 they¦181748 possessed¦181748 Shomron¦181751 \add !(Samaria¦181744)\add* and lived¦181752 in its¦181753 towns.
