\p “It's¦185527 the prophet's tomb,” the people¦185528 of¦185531 Beyt-El replied, “\add The one\add* who¦185534 came¦185536 from¦185537 Yehudah¦185537 and predicted that \add ≈what you¦185544 just did¦185544 to that\add* altar¦185546 would happen.”
